ate(49)" text-anchor="start" dy="0.36em">&#x261C;</text></g><g class="col-rose" transform="translate(542 384)"><circle r="12"/><path d="M0 -12 L2.8 -2.8 L12 0 L2.8 2.8 L0 12 L-2.8 2.8 L-12 0 L-2.8 -2.8 Z"/><text y="-16">N</text></g><text class="col-title" x="23" y="400">A Chart of the Lessons</text></svg>","card":"","caption":"","seat":"head","cardLeft":"0","cardTop":"0","foldWidth":"40rem"};
